  "description": "The shared kernel of CloudCanvas — a durable substrate of logic, contracts, and infrastructure boundaries \n\t\tthat form the connective tissue between independently deployed function apps. \n\t\tBuilt to resist chaos, encourage composability, and abstract away cloud primitives into focused intentions. \n\t\tThis package enables a philosophy of separation through precision, and cooperation through clearly defined contracts. \n\t\tIt is the backbone of CloudCanvas’ orchestration-aware, event-driven architecture.",
